                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is alright. I'm all for trying something new when it comes to a predefined genre. However, the spinning of the map just didn't fit for me personally. I'm sure many people will enjoy it and that is fine. I'm just not a fan of puzzle games and I feel like that's what this feature brings to the game. I found it very tedious and it quickly ruined the overall Tower Defense experience for me. Tower Defense is probably my favorite genre and without the map rotations feature, this would have been right up my alley. For me personally I would rate it 6/10.",
